                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-xl-12">
                                        <div class="card" id="ai-ask-card">
                                            <div class="card-header border-0 align-items-center d-flex">
                                                <h4 class="card-title mb-0 flex-grow-1"><i
                                                        class="ri-question-answer-line align-middle me-1 text-primary"></i>Ask
                                                    a Question</h4>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="card-body">
                                                <p class="text-muted fs-12 mb-2">
                                                    Ask about institutional partnership analytics in plain language
                                                    (e.g. "Which institutional units have the largest partnership
                                                    gaps?"). Gemini only classifies your question into a supported
                                                    topic and interprets the figures CIPRMS already computes — it
